Mandible

Inspired by Hive.

Rules restated in our own words; pieces, names, insect carvings, table and text are our own, made in code for
this game (src/art.c). No third-party art, fonts or sounds beyond the engine's own (cartwheel-engine, MIT; its
built-in fonts and their licences ship with the engine).

